          "_name": "list06",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"list06\" group=\"List\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"9\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showMainTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showMainSubtitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Position\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Date\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"List 1\" name=\"showList1\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"List 2\" name=\"showList2\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Card BG\" name=\"cardbg\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Bullet Color\" name=\"iconColor\" value=\"#1f0812\" selected>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffeddf\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"col-12 mb-5 content-head\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle || showMainSubtitle\">\n            <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\"><b>Meretas Jalan Keluar: Solusi Tiga Pilar</b></h3>\n            <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showMainSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n                Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit.\n            </h5>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center \">\n            <div class=\" col-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 active\">\n                    <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                        <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>A. Peran Pemerintah sebagai Regulator</b></h5>\n                        <h6 class=\"mbr-card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                            Stellar Corporation, January 2020 - December 2022<br>\n                        </h6>\n                        <h6 class=\"mbr-card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showList1\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"></h6>\n                        <div class=\"counter-container mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showList1\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                            <ul>\n                                <li><b>Pembaruan Kerangka Hukum:</b> Kementerian Ketenagakerjaan perlu menerbitkan aturan khusus yang menetapkan kriteria pekerja platform digital, sehingga mereka mendapatkan standar hak minimum seperti pembatasan jam kerja aman, penetapan batas maksimal komisi aplikasi, serta jaminan keselamatan kerja.</li><li><b>Pengawasan Kebijakan Sanksi:</b> Membentuk badan pengawas atau mekanisme mediasi independen yang mewajibkan perusahaan platform membuka standar operasional penonaktifan akun dan menyediakan saluran banding resmi bagi pengemudi yang dirugikan.</li><li><b>Penguatan Jaminan Sosial Inklusif:</b> Mewajibkan integrasi pendaftaran BPJS Ketenagakerjaan dan BPJS Kesehatan ke dalam sistem aplikasi dengan skema iuran terjangkau yang disubsidi bersama antara perusahaan dan pekerja.</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                        <h6 class=\"mbr-card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showList2\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                            <b>Achievements</b>\n                        </h6>\n                        <div class=\"counter-container mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showList2\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                            <ul>\n                                <li>Created a fresh logo for a prominent company that garnered positive feedback from\n                                    both its clientele and staff.</li>\n                                <li>Crafted a social media campaign resulting in over 1 million impressions.</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n                            <a class=\"btn btn-white\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                                Learn more</a>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n                    <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                        <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>B. Peran Perusahaan Platform</b></h5>\n                        <h6 class=\"mbr-card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                            Puppy Media, December 2021 - July 2022</h6>\n                        <h6 class=\"mbr-card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showList1\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br></p></h6>\n                        <div class=\"counter-container mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showList1\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                            <ul>\n                                <li><b>Penerapan Peninjauan oleh Manusia (Human Review):</b> Menyediakan tim layanan pelanggan berbasis manusia untuk meninjau kembali laporan negatif atau pengajuan banding penonaktifan akun, sehingga keputusan penting tidak sepenuhnya diserahkan pada mesin.\n</li><li><b>Fitur Pengindera Kelelahan:</b> Mengembangkan sistem peringatan otomatis dalam aplikasi yang menganjurkan pengemudi untuk beristirahat setelah mengemudi selama kurun waktu tertentu, tanpa memberikan sanksi penurunan performa.\n</li><li><b>Akses Dukungan Kesehatan Mental: </b>Bekerja sama dengan penyedia layanan psikologi untuk menyediakan saluran konseling gratis atau terjangkau bagi pengemudi yang mengalami stres kerja dan kecemasan tinggi</li><li>\n</li><li>\n</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                        <h6 class=\"mbr-card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showList2\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                            <b>Achievements</b>\n                        </h6>\n                        <div class=\"counter-container mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showList2\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                            <ul>\n                                <li>Designed and developed an advertising campaign.</li>\n                                <li>Increased social media engagement by 20%.</li>\n                                <li>Developed creative concepts for marketing campaigns that resulted in a 10% increase\n                                    in sales.</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n                            <a class=\"btn btn-white\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                                Learn more</a>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n                    <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                        <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>C. Peran Masyarakat dan Komunitas</b></h5>\n                        <h6 class=\"mbr-card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                            Puppy Media, December 2021 - July 2022</h6>\n                        <h6 class=\"mbr-card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showList1\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br></p></h6>\n                        <div class=\"counter-container mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showList1\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                            <ul>\n                                <li><b>Edukasi Empati Konsumen: </b>Mengampanyekan gerakan etika beraplikasi di kalangan masyarakat pengguna jasa untuk tidak memberikan ulasan buruk secara sembarangan, bijak dalam memberikan rating, serta memperlakukan kurir dan pengemudi secara sopan.\n</li><li><b>Penguatan Solidaritas Pekerja: </b>Mendorong paguyuban pengemudi lokal seperti SPAI menjadi wadah edukasi hak hukum, pertolongan pertama pada kecelakaan lalu lintas, serta ruang berbagi untuk menjaga kesehatan mental sesama anggota.</li><li><b>\n</b></li><li>\n</li><li>\n</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                        <h6 class=\"mbr-card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showList2\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                            <b>Achievements</b>\n                        </h6>\n                        <div class=\"counter-container mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showList2\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                            <ul>\n                                <li>Designed and developed an advertising campaign.</li>\n                                <li>Increased social media engagement by 20%.</li>\n                                <li>Developed creative concepts for marketing campaigns that resulted in a 10% increase\n                                    in sales.</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n                            <a class=\"btn btn-white\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                                Learn more</a>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "vy0kKFCPqM",
          "_anchor": "list06-1x",
          "_protectedParams": [],
